# Placeholder Resume

This is a placeholder file for your resume. 

To add your actual resume:
1. Save your resume as a PDF file
2. Name it "resume.pdf" 
3. Replace this file with your actual resume
4. Ensure the file size is reasonable for web download (< 5MB recommended)

Your resume will be accessible via the "Resume" link in the navigation menu.

## Resume Content Suggestions:

- Contact Information
- Professional Summary
- Technical Skills
- Security Certifications
- Work Experience
- Education
- Notable Achievements
- Security Projects
- Publications/Research (if applicable)

Remember to keep your resume updated and tailored for cybersecurity roles.